{"4014600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HOSTILE", "steam_appid": 4014600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the mysterious lack of communication from the O.R.S. facility as you make your way through the maze of rooms and corridors of this 3D Metroidvania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore through the various sectors of the station to find clues as to what has caused the radio silence. Discover traces left behind by the stations now missing inhabitants. Fight or avoid the hazards that now roam the empty corridors. Upgrade your arsenal by locating new weapons and useful equipment throughout the station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through the dark corridors and shed light on the dark events that unfolded before your arrival and now stalk you through the halls.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the mysterious lack of communication from the O.R.S. facility as you make your way through the maze of rooms and corridors of this 3D Metroidvania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore through the various sectors of the station to find clues as to what has caused the radio silence. Discover traces left behind by the stations now missing inhabitants. Fight or avoid the hazards that now roam the empty corridors. Upgrade your arsenal by locating new weapons and useful equipment throughout the station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through the dark corridors and shed light on the dark events that unfolded before your arrival and now stalk you through the halls.</p>", "short_description": "Explore a vast space station caught in a crisis and adrift in the void. Discover new weapons, fight challenging foes, and discover the dark secrets of Project HOSTILE in this in this Sci-fi Metroidvania.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014600/13c9da6bf5d5d